Feature: Edit a draft claim

  The owner replaces the purpose, currency and lines of a DRAFT or REJECTED claim at the version they
  read; the claim is then a DRAFT at the next version.

  Scenario: The owner edits a draft
    When I run "edit_draft" with:
      | caller.role | caller.employee_id | claim_id       | version | actor_id | purpose               | currency | lines                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   | receipts_in_use | stored_claim                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
      | employee    | emp-1              | CLM-0000000123 | 1       | emp-1    | Client visit in Basel | CHF      | [{"category": "LODGING", "expense_date": "2026-11-03", "description": "Hotel", "amount": 9000, "receipt": {"sha256": "bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb", "media_type": "image/png", "size_bytes": 80000}}, {"category": "MEALS", "expense_date": "2026-11-03", "description": "Lunch", "amount": 2000}] | []              | {"claim_id": "CLM-0000000123", "version": 1, "employee_id": "emp-1", "manager_id": "mgr-1", "state": "DRAFT", "purpose": "Client visit in Bern", "currency": "EUR", "total": 2000, "lines": [{"category": "MEALS", "expense_date": "2026-11-03", "description": "Lunch", "amount": 2000}]} |
    Then the output is "claim":
      | claim_id       | state | total | currency | version | purpose               |
      | CLM-0000000123 | DRAFT | 11000 | CHF      | 2       | Client visit in Basel |

  Scenario: A rejected claim goes back to DRAFT
    When I run "edit_draft" with:
      | caller.role | caller.employee_id | claim_id       | version | actor_id | purpose               | currency | lines                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   | receipts_in_use | stored_claim                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
      | employee    | emp-1              | CLM-0000000123 | 3       | emp-1    | Client visit in Basel | CHF      | [{"category": "LODGING", "expense_date": "2026-11-03", "description": "Hotel", "amount": 9000, "receipt": {"sha256": "bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb", "media_type": "image/png", "size_bytes": 80000}}, {"category": "MEALS", "expense_date": "2026-11-03", "description": "Lunch", "amount": 2000}] | []              | {"claim_id": "CLM-0000000123", "version": 3, "employee_id": "emp-1", "manager_id": "mgr-1", "state": "REJECTED", "purpose": "Client visit in Bern", "currency": "EUR", "total": 2000, "lines": [{"category": "MEALS", "expense_date": "2026-11-03", "description": "Lunch", "amount": 2000}], "submitted_at": "2026-11-10T09:00:00Z", "reason": "The hotel needs an itemised receipt"} |
    Then the output is "claim":
      | claim_id       | state | version |
      | CLM-0000000123 | DRAFT | 4       |

  Scenario: An edit of a claim that does not exist is refused
    When I run "edit_draft" with:
      | caller.role | caller.employee_id | claim_id       | version | actor_id | purpose               | currency | lines                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   | receipts_in_use |
      | employee    | emp-1              | CLM-0000000123 | 1       | emp-1    | Client visit in Basel | CHF      | [{"category": "LODGING", "expense_date": "2026-11-03", "description": "Hotel", "amount": 9000, "receipt": {"sha256": "bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb", "media_type": "image/png", "size_bytes": 80000}}, {"category": "MEALS", "expense_date": "2026-11-03", "description": "Lunch", "amount": 2000}] | []              |
    Then the output is "not_found":
      | claim_id       |
      | CLM-0000000123 |

  Scenario: Another employee may not edit the claim
    When I run "edit_draft" with:
      | caller.role | caller.employee_id | claim_id       | version | actor_id | purpose               | currency | lines                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   | receipts_in_use | stored_claim                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
      | employee    | emp-2              | CLM-0000000123 | 1       | emp-2    | Client visit in Basel | CHF      | [{"category": "LODGING", "expense_date": "2026-11-03", "description": "Hotel", "amount": 9000, "receipt": {"sha256": "bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb", "media_type": "image/png", "size_bytes": 80000}}, {"category": "MEALS", "expense_date": "2026-11-03", "description": "Lunch", "amount": 2000}] | []              | {"claim_id": "CLM-0000000123", "version": 1, "employee_id": "emp-1", "manager_id": "mgr-1", "state": "DRAFT", "purpose": "Client visit in Bern", "currency": "EUR", "total": 2000, "lines": [{"category": "MEALS", "expense_date": "2026-11-03", "description": "Lunch", "amount": 2000}]} |
    Then the output is "forbidden":
