      | bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb |

  Scenario: A stored claim that is not the claim of the request is rejected
    When I run "edit_draft" with:
